# A library for the tests of rune --library (tests/lib/run-lib-tests.sh):
# the form of lib/basis/MANIFEST, one file per line, in load order.
#
#   file | always or demand | host | provides | requires
#
# A library's files name what they use of the basis library in the requires
# column, so that a program that names only the library loads it.
toy.sml   | demand | yes | Toy   | Int
extra.sml | demand | yes | Extra |
